FFmpeg (in the Windows package)
------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Windows package of the desktop app carries ffmpeg.exe and ffprobe.exe,
the unmodified gyan.dev "full" build (https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/),
in its ffmpeg\ folder. That build is licensed under the GNU General Public
License version 3 (ffmpeg\LICENSE.txt); where its source is: ffmpeg\SOURCE.txt.
RUDRA runs it as a separate program and is not linked to it, so RUDRA's own
licence is unchanged.
